msgstr "Tentang"

msgid "Privacy policy"
msgstr "Kebijakan privasi"

msgid "Solua does not collect, store or send any personal data. It has no accounts, no analytics and makes no network connections. Your settings stay in a local file on this computer, and the only communication is between the app and your monitors through the standard DDC/CI protocol."
msgstr "Solua tidak mengumpulkan, menyimpan, atau mengirim data pribadi apa pun. Tidak ada akun, tidak ada analitik, dan tidak ada koneksi jaringan. Pengaturan Anda tersimpan di file lokal di komputer ini, dan satu-satunya komunikasi terjadi antara aplikasi dan monitor Anda melalui protokol standar DDC/CI."

msgid "Open source licenses"
msgstr "Lisensi sumber terbuka"

msgid "Close"
msgstr "Tutup"

msgid "All monitors"
msgstr "Semua monitor"

msgid "No profiles yet."
msgstr "Belum ada profil."

msgid "A saved profile is active. Switch to “Free” to adjust settings."
msgstr "Profil tersimpan sedang aktif. Beralih ke “Bebas” untuk mengubah pengaturan."

msgid "Allow modifying saved profiles"
msgstr "Izinkan mengubah profil tersimpan"

msgid "BACKUP"
msgstr "CADANGAN"

msgid "Backup saved"
msgstr "Cadangan disimpan"

