msgstr "Frekuensi horizontal"

msgid "IMAGE"
msgstr "GAMBAR"

msgid "MONITOR AUDIO"
msgstr "AUDIO MONITOR"

msgid "MONITOR INFORMATION"
msgstr "INFORMASI MONITOR"

msgid "Monitor volume"
msgstr "Volume monitor"

msgid "Mute the monitor audio"
msgstr "Bisukan audio monitor"

msgid "Not reported"
msgstr "Tidak dilaporkan"

msgid "Panel technology"
msgstr "Teknologi panel"

msgid "Restore factory defaults"
msgstr "Pulihkan default pabrik"

msgid "Scales each color channel. It mostly affects the bright areas of the image."
msgstr "Mengatur skala setiap kanal warna. Terutama memengaruhi area terang pada gambar."

msgid "Sets the level of the darkest areas of each color channel. It mostly affects the shadows, not the whites."
msgstr "Mengatur level area tergelap pada setiap kanal warna. Terutama memengaruhi bayangan, bukan warna putih."

msgid "Show in the mini panel"
msgstr "Tampilkan di panel mini"

msgid "This is the audio of the monitor itself (its speakers or headphone jack), for monitors that have it. It is not the system volume."
msgstr "Ini adalah audio monitor itu sendiri (speaker atau jack headphone-nya), untuk monitor yang memilikinya. Bukan volume sistem."

msgid "VCP version"
msgstr "Versi VCP"

msgid "Vertical frequency (refresh rate)"
msgstr "Frekuensi vertikal (refresh rate)"

msgid "Color filter"
msgstr "Filter warna"

msgid "Software filter applied to the whole system."
msgstr "Filter perangkat lunak yang diterapkan ke seluruh sistem."

msgid "Monitor volume up"
msgstr "Naikkan volume monitor"

msgid "Monitor volume down"
msgstr "Turunkan volume monitor"

msgid "Mute/unmute the monitor audio"
msgstr "Bisukan/aktifkan audio monitor"

msgid "Input"
msgstr "Masukan"

msgid "Shortcuts are assigned by your desktop. You can change them in System Settings → Shortcuts."
msgstr "Pintasan ditetapkan oleh desktop Anda. Anda dapat mengubahnya di Pengaturan Sistem → Pintasan."

msgid "Sliders move in fixed steps, marked with dots."
msgstr "Slider bergerak dalam langkah tetap, ditandai dengan titik."

msgid "Adjust all together"
msgstr "Atur semuanya bersamaan"

msgid "Changes in Controls and Color are applied to every monitor."
msgstr "Perubahan di Kontrol dan Warna diterapkan ke setiap monitor."

msgid "Violet"
msgstr "Violet"

msgid "Set an end time"
msgstr "Atur waktu selesai"

msgid "When it ends, the previous profile is restored."
msgstr "Setelah selesai, profil sebelumnya dipulihkan."

msgid "Transparency"
msgstr "Transparansi"

msgid "Run in the background"
msgstr "Jalankan di latar belakang"

msgid "Default"
msgstr "Bawaan"

msgid "A DDC/CI monitor controller built with Rust and Slint. Extremely light and fast."
msgstr "Pengendali monitor DDC/CI yang dibuat dengan Rust dan Slint. Sangat ringan dan cepat."

msgid "Add to the applications menu"
msgstr "Tambahkan ke menu aplikasi"

msgid "Could not enable monitor access."
msgstr "Tidak dapat mengaktifkan akses monitor."

msgid "Creates a launcher for this AppImage."
msgstr "Membuat peluncur untuk AppImage ini."

msgid "Enable monitor access"
msgstr "Aktifkan akses monitor"

msgid "Keeps Solua running when the window is closed, so shortcuts keep working."
msgstr "Menjaga Solua tetap berjalan saat jendela ditutup, agar pintasan tetap berfungsi."

msgid "Monitor access enabled."
msgstr "Akses monitor diaktifkan."

msgid "Solua cannot reach your monitors yet. Enabling access sets up a small system rule and asks for your password."
msgstr "Solua belum dapat menjangkau monitor Anda. Mengaktifkan akses akan menyiapkan aturan sistem kecil dan meminta kata sandi Anda."

msgid "Start with the system"
msgstr "Mulai bersama sistem"

msgid "Starts Solua hidden when you log in."
msgstr "Memulai Solua secara tersembunyi saat Anda masuk."

msgid "12-hour clock (AM/PM)"
msgstr "Jam 12 jam (AM/PM)"
